# Markdown under docs/ is local working material — migration plans, design
# drafts, prompts — with one exception: docs/design.md is the shipped design
# note, linked from both READMEs and listed in package.json's `files`, so it
# stays tracked. Release notes are covered by the same rule; every release's
# notes are generated into the GitHub Release by .github/workflows/release.yml
# rather than carried in the repository.
docs/*.md
!docs/design.md
